# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile = the repository root (BuildKit uses this file instead
# of a .dockerignore at the root). Everything is excluded except the build inputs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!README.md
!src/
!config/
!data/hist/
!web/

# re-excluded inside the inputs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/node_modules
web/dist
# built in the image by the `web` stage
src/futrisk/web_static/dist
